    "detailed_description": "Call your friends and prepare to face-off in a virtual arcade showdown! These multiplayer games allow you to band together as a group to save the day, or turn on each other to see who comes out victorious! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nDesigned for in-person gameplay with a crowd, Ricky's Rockin\u2019 Arcade will provide up to five unique arcade games for you to enjoy. The first game is out now, with four more coming this summer! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nTry your luck in an infiltrator race through a neon landscape with your fellow hackers. Once you\u2019ve experienced Ricky\u2019s first game, you\u2019ll be anxious to see what else he has in store for you! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nPerfect for game nights, group hangouts, and anytime you\u2019d rather be battling monsters than small-talk!",
